   167	
   168	**Setup and standing hypotheses.**
   169	`F: A^2 -> A^2` polynomial, étale (Keller), not an automorphism,
   170	`d = [C(x,y):C(F_1,F_2)] >= 2`. `A_F` = Jelonek's non-properness set,
   171	a curve, pure codimension one (Jelonek, *The set of points at which a
   172	polynomial map is not proper*, Ann. Polon. Math. 58 (1993) 259–266).
