   184	in a normal variety has pure-codimension-one complement), and
   185	`A_F = q(B_Y)` exactly (a limit escaping `U` with bounded image is
   186	trapped in a `q`-compact set, and conversely `U` is dense). *This
   187	reproduces the block-descent architecture with no block hypothesis.*
