   381	of points of `{1,2,3,4}` fixed by the image subgroup.** Then apply the
   382	quota. No new enumeration, no CAS, no new theory — a fixed-point count
   383	on tuples already written down. Outcomes: a surviving row whose every
   384	colouring violates the quota is **dead**; a row where the quota selects
   385	a proper subset of colourings is **sharpened** (and its successor
   386	analysis shrinks); a row where all colourings satisfy the quota is
   387	**unchanged but now typed**. Because the quota is an equality, it can
   388	kill rows that colourability alone cannot — which is precisely the
   389	capability the saturation result says the ladder lacks.
